{const H={"rw": {"Debit card for your itunda Bank account": "Ikarita ya debit ya konti yawe ya itunda Bank", "Earn 3% when people buy via your links.": "Wunguka 3% ku gura ryose rikozwe binyuze kuri link wasangije.", "Links shared": "Link zasangijwe", "Total clicks": "Inshuro zose bakanze", "Total earned": "Yose wungutse", "Product wishlist": "Ibicuruzwa nkunda", "Marketplace wishlist": "Ibyo nkunda ku isoko", "Jobs wishlist": "Akazi nkunda", "Property wishlist": "Imitungo nkunda", "Restaurant favorites": "Resitora nkunda", "Jobs posted": "Akazi nashyizeho", "Property listed": "Imitungo nashyizeho", "Your name, numbers and counts are sample data.": "Izina, imibare n'ibyo kubara ni ibitegererezo.", "Conversations are sample data. Send money, gifts and split bills right in a chat.": "Ibiganiro ni ibitegererezo. Ohereza amafaranga, impano ukanagabana fagitire muri chat.", "Products from every merchant": "Ibicuruzwa by'abacuruzi bose", "Order food or deliver": "Tumiza ibiryo cyangwa ubishyikirize", "Rwanda map": "Ikarita y'u Rwanda", "Buy and sell near you": "Gura ugurishe hafi yawe", "Local questions and posts": "Ibibazo n'ibyashyizwe aho utuye", "Neighbourhood gigs and part-time work": "Imirimo yo mu gace n'akazi ka make", "Rentals and sales near you": "Gukodesha no kugurisha hafi yawe", "Points, coupons, rewards": "Amanota, amakuponi, ibihembo", "RSE stocks, real portfolio": "Imigabane ya RSE, portfolio nyayo", "Escalating auto-save, streak bonus": "Kubika byikora byiyongera, igihembo cyo gukomeza", "Daily streak, tiered bonus rate": "Gukomeza buri munsi, igipimo cy'igihembo", "26-Week Savings": "Kubika mu byumweru 26", "31-Day Savings": "Kubika mu minsi 31", "Open": "Fungura", "Youth": "Urubyiruko", "Games": "Imikino", "Bank": "Banki", "Shortcuts": "Inzira ngufi", "Verify": "Emeza", "Send": "Ohereza", "Group": "Itsinda", "Insurance": "Ubwishingizi", "Pick": "Hitamo", "View my profile": "Reba umwirondoro wanjye", "You": "Wowe"}, "fr": {"Debit card for your itunda Ban